# The Rust image builds from the repo root; send only what it compiles.
*
!backend-rs/Cargo.toml
!backend-rs/Cargo.lock
!backend-rs/src
# sqlx::migrate!() embeds these at compile time, so they must reach the build
# context. Without this line the COPY fails with "/backend-rs/migrations": not
# found -- the file is committed, it just never arrives.
!backend-rs/migrations
# Every game's data file is read at COMPILE time with include_str!, so it
# must reach the build context too, or rustc fails with "couldn't read ...".
!backend-rs/data
